<view class="page">
  <view class="title">最近房间</view>
  <view class="muted">这里保存本机入口；云端房间会一直存在，直到房主主动解散。</view>

  <view wx:if="{{!rooms.length}}" class="card muted">还没有最近房间，可从首页创建或输入房间码加入。</view>

  <view
    wx:for="{{rooms}}"
    wx:key="docId"
    class="card trip-row"
    bindtap="open"
    data-id="{{item.docId}}"
    data-type="{{item.room.toolType}}"
  >
    <view class="trip-icon">{{item.typeIcon}}</view>
    <view class="trip-copy">
      <view class="trip-name">{{item.room.name}}</view>
      <view class="muted">{{item.typeLabel}} · 房间码 {{item.room.code}}</view>
    </view>
    <button class="remove-button" catchtap="remove" data-id="{{item.docId}}">移除</button>
  </view>
</view>
